WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.096
A finitely presented Burnside group.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.512
Golod found infinite groups of finite-order elements,

3
00:00:05.512 --> 00:00:07.836
but they needed infinitely many relations.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.388
Nilness of a graded algebra becomes periodicity

5
00:00:11.388 --> 00:00:13.606
of its finitely presented Steinberg group.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.271
Claimed: infinite and periodic, yet finitely presented.

7
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:18.901
Lean: part only.
